              "body": [
                {
                  "type": "TextualBody",
                  "value": "Under the cipher reading, the central rosette's label is the key to the whole foldout — a place-name or cosmological term whose decryption would unlock the map's geography. [See the Rosettes alone, deep-zoomed.](https://micahchoo.github.io/Archie/viewer/#/voynich-rosettes) (§H cross-link, 03 §5: repointed from the sunset bidar exhibit to the SINGLE Rosettes study — `archie:` in-body ref grammar from link.ts, rewritten to the published voynich-rosettes URL on the heads projection; resolves to the exhibit root.)",
                  "purpose": "commenting"
                },
                {
                  "type": "TextualBody",
                  "value": "astronomical-symbol",
                  "purpose": "tagging"
                },
                {
                  "type": "TextualBody",
                  "value": "foldout",
                  "purpose": "tagging"
                },
                {
                  "type": "TextualBody",
                  "value": "label-word",
                  "purpose": "tagging"
                }
              ],
              "motivation": "commenting",
              "created": "1970-01-01T00:00:00.002Z",
              "creator": {
                "type": "Person",
                "name": "curator"
              },
              "archie:logicalId": "0000000002NSJFHKCVBDB9PX0X",
              "archie:reading": "cipher",
              "archie:hasHistory": "https://micahchoo.github.io/Archie/viewer/published/voynich-rosettes/annotations/history/0000000002NSJFHKCVBDB9PX0X.json"
            }
          ],
          "partOf": [
