              "modified": "1970-01-01T00:00:00.003Z",
              "body": [
                {
                  "type": "TextualBody",
                  "value": "Under the grille reading, the label is decorative gibberish; the causeways and castles are an impressive visual forgery, and the text laid over them carries no place-names because it carries nothing.",
                  "purpose": "commenting"
                }
              ],
              "motivation": "commenting",
